	('44000000-0000-4000-8000-001000000268', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'Which date matches the declaration of Ghana''s independence?', '["1952", "1964", "1969", "1957"]', '"1957"', 'The declaration of Ghana''s independence occurred in 1957. Ghana''s independence followed the end of British colonial rule in the Gold Coast.', 'Wikipedia: History of Ghana', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_Ghana', 'history', 60),
	('44000000-0000-4000-8000-001000000269', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'Who became independent Ghana''s first prime minister?', '["Kwame Nkrumah", "Archduke Franz Ferdinand", "Vladimir Lenin", "Mustafa Kemal Ataturk"]', '"Kwame Nkrumah"', 'The declaration of Ghana''s independence occurred in 1957. Ghana''s independence followed the end of British colonial rule in the Gold Coast.', 'Wikipedia: History of Ghana', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_Ghana', 'history', 60),
	('44000000-0000-4000-8000-001000000270', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'What was the British colony called before it became independent Ghana?', '["Northern Rhodesia", "Gold Coast", "Nyasaland", "Tanganyika"]', '"Gold Coast"', 'The declaration of Ghana''s independence occurred in 1957. Ghana''s independence followed the end of British colonial rule in the Gold Coast. The Gold Coast and British Togoland became independent Ghana.', 'Wikipedia: History of Ghana', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_Ghana', 'history', 60),
	('44000000-0000-4000-8000-001000000271', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'In which year did the first human journey into space occur?', '["1956", "1968", "1961", "1973"]', '"1961"', 'The first human journey into space occurred in 1961. Gagarin completed one orbit aboard Vostok 1.', 'Wikipedia: Vostok 1', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vostok_1', 'history', 60),
	('44000000-0000-4000-8000-001000000272', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'Who became the first human to travel into space?', '["Vladimir Lenin", "Mustafa Kemal Ataturk", "Charles Lindbergh", "Yuri Gagarin"]', '"Yuri Gagarin"', 'The first human journey into space occurred in 1961. Gagarin completed one orbit aboard Vostok 1.', 'Wikipedia: Vostok 1', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vostok_1', 'history', 60),
	('44000000-0000-4000-8000-001000000273', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'In 1961, where was the setting for the first human journey into space?', '["Soviet Union", "England", "France", "Ghana"]', '"Soviet Union"', 'The first human journey into space occurred in 1961. Gagarin completed one orbit aboard Vostok 1.', 'Wikipedia: Vostok 1', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vostok_1', 'history', 60),
	('44000000-0000-4000-8000-001000000274', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'Which year saw the I Have a Dream speech at the March on Washington?', '["1958", "1963", "1970", "1975"]', '"1963"', 'The I Have a Dream speech at the March on Washington occurred in 1963. The speech was delivered at the Lincoln Memorial during a civil rights march.', 'Wikipedia: I Have a Dream', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I_Have_a_Dream', 'history', 60),
	('44000000-0000-4000-8000-001000000275', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'Who delivered the I Have a Dream speech in 1963?', '["Mustafa Kemal Ataturk", "Charles Lindbergh", "Martin Luther King Jr.", "Alexander Fleming"]', '"Martin Luther King Jr."', 'The I Have a Dream speech at the March on Washington occurred in 1963. The speech was delivered at the Lincoln Memorial during a civil rights march.', 'Wikipedia: I Have a Dream', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I_Have_a_Dream', 'history', 60),
	('44000000-0000-4000-8000-001000000276', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'Which place witnessed the I Have a Dream speech at the March on Washington in 1963?', '["Hanoi", "Hong Kong", "Jakarta", "Washington, D.C."]', '"Washington, D.C."', 'The I Have a Dream speech at the March on Washington occurred in 1963. The speech was delivered at the Lincoln Memorial during a civil rights march.', 'Wikipedia: I Have a Dream', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I_Have_a_Dream', 'history', 60),
	('44000000-0000-4000-8000-001000000277', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'What is the year associated with the first human landing on the Moon?', '["1969", "1964", "1976", "1981"]', '"1969"', 'The first human landing on the Moon occurred in 1969. Armstrong stepped onto the lunar surface during the Apollo 11 mission.', 'Wikipedia: Apollo 11', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_11', 'history', 60),
	('44000000-0000-4000-8000-001000000278', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'Who became the first person to walk on the Moon?', '["Charles Lindbergh", "Neil Armstrong", "Alexander Fleming", "Mahatma Gandhi"]', '"Neil Armstrong"', 'The first human landing on the Moon occurred in 1969. Armstrong stepped onto the lunar surface during the Apollo 11 mission.', 'Wikipedia: Apollo 11', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_11', 'history', 60),
	('44000000-0000-4000-8000-001000000279', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'What was the name of the Apollo 11 lunar module?', '["Columbia", "Aquarius", "Eagle", "Challenger"]', '"Eagle"', 'The first human landing on the Moon occurred in 1969. Armstrong stepped onto the lunar surface during the Apollo 11 mission. Eagle carried Armstrong and Aldrin to the surface; Columbia was the command module.', 'Wikipedia: Apollo 11', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_11', 'history', 60),
	('44000000-0000-4000-8000-001000000280', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'When did the resignation of the US president after Watergate take place?', '["1969", "1981", "1986", "1974"]', '"1974"', 'The resignation of the US president after Watergate occurred in 1974. Nixon resigned before the House could vote on articles of impeachment.', 'Wikipedia: Resignation of Richard Nixon', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Resignation_of_Richard_Nixon', 'history', 60),
	('44000000-0000-4000-8000-001000000281', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'Which US president resigned following the Watergate scandal?', '["Richard Nixon", "Alexander Fleming", "Mahatma Gandhi", "Abdulaziz Ibn Saud"]', '"Richard Nixon"', 'The resignation of the US president after Watergate occurred in 1974. Nixon resigned before the House could vote on articles of impeachment.', 'Wikipedia: Resignation of Richard Nixon', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Resignation_of_Richard_Nixon', 'history', 60),
	('44000000-0000-4000-8000-001000000282', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'Who succeeded Richard Nixon as US president after his resignation?', '["Jimmy Carter", "Gerald Ford", "Ronald Reagan", "Lyndon B. Johnson"]', '"Gerald Ford"', 'The resignation of the US president after Watergate occurred in 1974. Nixon resigned before the House could vote on articles of impeachment. Vice President Gerald Ford took office after Nixon resigned.', 'Wikipedia: Resignation of Richard Nixon', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Resignation_of_Richard_Nixon', 'history', 60),
	('44000000-0000-4000-8000-001000000283', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'Which date matches the Iranian Revolution overthrowing the Shah?', '["1974", "1986", "1979", "1991"]', '"1979"', 'The Iranian Revolution overthrowing the Shah occurred in 1979. The revolution replaced the monarchy with an Islamic republic.', 'Wikipedia: Iranian Revolution', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iranian_Revolution', 'history', 60),
	('44000000-0000-4000-8000-001000000284', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'Which religious leader became Iran''s supreme leader after the 1979 revolution?', '["Mahatma Gandhi", "Abdulaziz Ibn Saud", "Mao Zedong", "Ruhollah Khomeini"]', '"Ruhollah Khomeini"', 'The Iranian Revolution overthrowing the Shah occurred in 1979. The revolution replaced the monarchy with an Islamic republic.', 'Wikipedia: Iranian Revolution', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iranian_Revolution', 'history', 60),
	('44000000-0000-4000-8000-001000000285', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'In 1979, where was the setting for the Iranian Revolution overthrowing the Shah?', '["Iran", "Haiti", "India", "Italy"]', '"Iran"', 'The Iranian Revolution overthrowing the Shah occurred in 1979. The revolution replaced the monarchy with an Islamic republic.', 'Wikipedia: Iranian Revolution', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iranian_Revolution', 'history', 60),
	('44000000-0000-4000-8000-001000000286', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'In which year did the appointment of the first female British prime minister occur?', '["1974", "1979", "1986", "1991"]', '"1979"', 'The appointment of the first female British prime minister occurred in 1979. Thatcher took office after the Conservative election victory.', 'Wikipedia: Margaret Thatcher', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Margaret_Thatcher', 'history', 60),
