	('44000000-0000-4000-8000-001000000289', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'Which year saw the first appointment of a female prime minister in a Muslim-majority country?', '["1988", "1983", "1995", "2000"]', '"1988"', 'The first appointment of a female prime minister in a Muslim-majority country occurred in 1988. Bhutto was the first woman to lead a Muslim-majority country''s government.', 'Wikipedia: Benazir Bhutto', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Benazir_Bhutto', 'history', 60),
