('41000000-0000-4000-8000-060000000171','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which DNA base pairs with guanine?','["Adenine", "Thymine", "Cytosine", "Uracil"]','"Cytosine"','In DNA, guanine pairs with cytosine.','OpenStax: science textbooks','https://openstax.org/subjects/science','science',60),
