('41000000-0000-4000-8000-060000000195','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which simple machine consists of a rigid bar pivoting around a fulcrum?','["Pulley", "Screw", "Lever", "Wedge"]','"Lever"','A lever turns around a pivot called a fulcrum.','Wikipedia: Lever','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lever','science',60),
