('41000000-0000-4000-8000-020000000001','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','What currency is used in Thailand?','["Baht", "Riel", "Kip", "Ringgit"]','"Baht"','Thailand''s currency is the baht.','Wikipedia: Thai baht','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thai_baht','thailand',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-020000000002','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','What language is Thailand''s official national language?','["Khmer", "Thai", "Lao", "Malay"]','"Thai"','Thai is the official language of Thailand.','Wikipedia: Thai language','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thai_language','thailand',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-020000000003','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which branch of Buddhism is predominant in Thailand?','["Vajrayana", "Zen", "Theravada", "Pure Land"]','"Theravada"','Theravada is the predominant Buddhist tradition in Thailand.','Wikipedia: Buddhism in Thailand','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buddhism_in_Thailand','thailand',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-020000000004','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Thailand was historically known by what name?','["Burma", "Annam", "Ceylon", "Siam"]','"Siam"','The country was internationally known as Siam before adopting the name Thailand.','Wikipedia: Thailand','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thailand','thailand',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-020000000005','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','In which year was the name Thailand first adopted in place of Siam?','["1939", "1925", "1947", "1960"]','"1939"','The government first changed the country''s name from Siam to Thailand in 1939.','Wikipedia: Thailand','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thailand','thailand',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-020000000006','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','What type of political system has Thailand had since the 1932 revolution?','["Absolute monarchy", "Constitutional monarchy", "Federal republic", "Presidential republic"]','"Constitutional monarchy"','The 1932 revolution ended absolute monarchy and established constitutional rule.','Wikipedia: Siamese revolution of 1932','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Siamese_revolution_of_1932','thailand',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-020000000007','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which dynasty founded the current Thai royal house in 1782?','["Ming dynasty", "Konbaung dynasty", "Chakri dynasty", "Nguyen dynasty"]','"Chakri dynasty"','The Chakri dynasty was established by Rama I in 1782.','Wikipedia: Chakri dynasty','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chakri_dynasty','thailand',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-020000000008','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which king founded Bangkok as the royal capital in 1782?','["Rama V", "Rama IX", "Rama IV", "Rama I"]','"Rama I"','Rama I established the capital on the east bank of the Chao Phraya at Bangkok.','Wikipedia: Rama I','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rama_I','thailand',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-020000000009','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which Thai king is also known as Chulalongkorn?','["Rama V", "Rama I", "Rama III", "Rama VIII"]','"Rama V"','King Chulalongkorn reigned as Rama V.','Wikipedia: Chulalongkorn','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chulalongkorn','thailand',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-020000000010','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which Thai king is also known as Mongkut?','["Rama II", "Rama IV", "Rama VI", "Rama IX"]','"Rama IV"','King Mongkut reigned as Rama IV.','Wikipedia: Mongkut','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mongkut','thailand',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-020000000011','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which Thai king was known as Bhumibol Adulyadej?','["Rama V", "Rama VII", "Rama IX", "Rama X"]','"Rama IX"','Bhumibol Adulyadej was Rama IX of the Chakri dynasty.','Wikipedia: Bhumibol Adulyadej','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bhumibol_Adulyadej','thailand',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-020000000012','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which regional organization counts Thailand among its 1967 founding members?','["European Union", "Mercosur", "African Union", "ASEAN"]','"ASEAN"','Thailand signed the Bangkok Declaration establishing ASEAN in 1967.','Wikipedia: ASEAN','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ASEAN','thailand',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-020000000013','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which city hosted the declaration that established ASEAN?','["Bangkok", "Jakarta", "Manila", "Singapore"]','"Bangkok"','The ASEAN Declaration was signed in Bangkok on 8 August 1967.','Wikipedia: ASEAN Declaration','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ASEAN_Declaration','thailand',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-020000000014','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which country borders Thailand on its southern land frontier?','["Vietnam", "Malaysia", "Indonesia", "Singapore"]','"Malaysia"','Thailand''s southern mainland boundary meets Malaysia.','Wikipedia: Geography of Thailand','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geography_of_Thailand','thailand',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-020000000015','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which country lies immediately west of much of Thailand?','["Vietnam", "Cambodia", "Myanmar", "Malaysia"]','"Myanmar"','Myanmar shares a long border with western and northwestern Thailand.','Wikipedia: Geography of Thailand','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geography_of_Thailand','thailand',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-020000000016','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which neighboring country has the temple complex Angkor Wat?','["Laos", "Myanmar", "Malaysia", "Cambodia"]','"Cambodia"','Angkor Wat is in Cambodia, Thailand''s southeastern neighbor.','Wikipedia: Angkor Wat','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angkor_Wat','thailand',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-020000000017','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which neighboring country has no coastline?','["Laos", "Cambodia", "Malaysia", "Myanmar"]','"Laos"','Laos is landlocked, unlike Thailand''s other land neighbors.','Wikipedia: Laos','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laos','thailand',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-020000000018','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','What is the international vehicle registration code commonly associated with Thailand?','["THA", "T", "TL", "TM"]','"T"','Thailand uses T as its international vehicle registration code.','Wikipedia: International vehicle registration code','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_vehicle_registration_code','thailand',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-020000000019','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','What side of the road does traffic generally drive on in Thailand?','["Right", "Either side freely", "Left", "Center only"]','"Left"','Thailand has left-hand traffic.','Wikipedia: Left- and right-hand traffic','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Left-_and_right-hand_traffic','thailand',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-020000000020','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','What international calling code is used for Thailand?','["+60", "+84", "+856", "+66"]','"+66"','Thailand''s country calling code is+66.','Wikipedia: Telephone numbers in Thailand','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Telephone_numbers_in_Thailand','thailand',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-020000000021','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which animal is a traditional national symbol of Thailand?','["Elephant", "Tiger", "Water buffalo", "Gaur"]','"Elephant"','Elephants have a long historical and cultural association with Thailand.','Wikipedia: Elephant in Thailand','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elephant_in_Thailand','thailand',60),
