('41000000-0000-4000-8000-030000000249','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','What is the principal ingredient in a traditional meringue?','["Egg whites", "Cream", "Butter", "Gelatin"]','"Egg whites"','Meringue is made from whipped egg whites and sugar.','Wikipedia: Meringue','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meringue','food',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-030000000250','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which ingredient is traditionally whipped to make whipped cream?','["Skim milk", "Heavy cream", "Yogurt", "Egg yolk"]','"Heavy cream"','Cream with sufficient milk fat can hold air when whipped.','Wikipedia: Whipped cream','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whipped_cream','food',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-030000000251','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','What is the base of a classic ganache?','["Flour and milk", "Egg and sugar", "Chocolate and cream", "Butter and vinegar"]','"Chocolate and cream"','Ganache is commonly made by combining chocolate with hot cream.','Wikipedia: Ganache','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ganache','food',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-030000000252','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which ingredient provides structure in a traditional wheat bread dough?','["Pectin", "Gelatin", "Casein", "Gluten"]','"Gluten"','Hydrated wheat proteins form a gluten network that traps gas in dough.','Wikipedia: Gluten','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gluten','food',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-030000000253','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which fruit component allows many jams to gel?','["Pectin", "Gluten", "Casein", "Cellulose only"]','"Pectin"','Pectin can form a gel with suitable sugar and acidity.','Wikipedia: Pectin','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pectin','food',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-030000000254','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which setting agent is traditionally derived from animal collagen?','["Agar", "Gelatin", "Pectin", "Cornstarch"]','"Gelatin"','Gelatin is obtained by processing collagen from animal tissues.','Wikipedia: Gelatin','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gelatin','food',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-030000000255','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which setting agent is extracted from red algae?','["Gelatin", "Pectin", "Agar", "Whey"]','"Agar"','Agar is a polysaccharide gelling agent obtained from red algae.','Wikipedia: Agar','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agar','food',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-030000000256','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which ingredient is typically used to acidify sushi rice?','["Sesame oil", "Soy sauce", "Mirin only", "Rice vinegar"]','"Rice vinegar"','Sushi rice is seasoned with a mixture that includes rice vinegar.','Wikipedia: Sushi','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sushi','food',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-030000000257','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which Japanese condiment is made from salted fermented plums?','["Umeboshi", "Wasabi", "Miso", "Ponzu"]','"Umeboshi"','Umeboshi are salted and pickled ume fruits, often called Japanese plums.','Wikipedia: Umeboshi','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Umeboshi','food',60),
