('41000000-0000-4000-8000-030000000262','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which flour is traditionally used in Ethiopian injera?','["Rye", "Teff", "Oat", "Rice"]','"Teff"','Injera is traditionally made with teff flour, though mixtures are also used.','Wikipedia: Injera','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Injera','food',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-030000000263','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','What type of grain is bulgur made from?','["Rice", "Oat", "Wheat", "Rye"]','"Wheat"','Bulgur consists of parboiled, dried and cracked wheat.','Wikipedia: Bulgur','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bulgur','food',60),
