('41000000-0000-4000-8000-030000000265','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which cereal grain is commonly malted for beer?','["Barley", "Rice only", "Millet only", "Oats only"]','"Barley"','Malted barley supplies enzymes and fermentable sugars in many beers.','Wikipedia: Malt','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Malt','food',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-030000000266','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','What is the main ingredient in traditional Scottish porridge?','["Rice", "Oats", "Corn", "Buckwheat"]','"Oats"','Traditional Scottish porridge is made by cooking oats in water or milk.','Wikipedia: Porridge','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Porridge','food',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-030000000267','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which vegetable is the base of baba ghanoush?','["Zucchini", "Pumpkin", "Eggplant", "Potato"]','"Eggplant"','Baba ghanoush is a Levantine dip based on cooked eggplant.','Wikipedia: Baba ganoush','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baba_ganoush','food',60),
