('41000000-0000-4000-8000-030000000272','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which food is fermented to make traditional tempeh?','["Chickpeas", "Peanuts", "Rice", "Soybeans"]','"Soybeans"','Tempeh is made by fermenting soybeans into a firm cake.','Wikipedia: Tempeh','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tempeh','food',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-030000000273','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which ingredient is the main basis of Japanese natto?','["Soybeans", "Rice", "Barley", "Mushrooms"]','"Soybeans"','Natto is made from soybeans fermented with Bacillus subtilis.','Wikipedia: Natto','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Natto','food',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-030000000274','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which vegetable is the principal ingredient in French onion soup?','["Leek", "Onion", "Cabbage", "Carrot"]','"Onion"','French onion soup is based on slowly cooked onions and stock.','Wikipedia: French onion soup','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/French_onion_soup','food',60),
('41000000-0000-4000-8000-030000000275','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','What is the primary ingredient of split-pea soup?','["Chickpeas", "Kidney beans", "Dried split peas", "Lentils"]','"Dried split peas"','Split-pea soup uses dried peas that have been split in half.','Wikipedia: Split pea','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Split_pea','food',60)
