('41000000-0000-4000-8004-000000000001','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which animal has venom-delivering spurs on the hind legs of adult males?','["Platypus", "Pistol shrimp", "Moray eel", "Sloth"]','"Platypus"','Male platypuses have venomous hind-leg spurs.','Encyclopaedia Britannica: Platypus','https://www.britannica.com/animal/platypus','weird',60),
