('41000000-0000-4000-8004-000000000233','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which chemical element is a lanthanide named after the mythological figure Prometheus?','["Promethium", "Iron", "Aluminium", "Calcium"]','"Promethium"','Promethium''s name honors Prometheus, who brought fire to humans.','Royal Society of Chemistry: Promethium','https://www.rsc.org/periodic-table/element/61/promethium','weird',60),
