('41000000-0000-4000-8000-050000000235','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','What is a species introduced outside its native range that causes ecological harm called?','["Keystone species", "Indicator species", "Invasive species", "Endemic species"]','"Invasive species"','An invasive species spreads outside its native range and causes harm.','Wikipedia: Invasive species','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Invasive_species','nature',60),
