('43000000-0000-4000-8003-000000000016','ESTIMATE','A cyclist rides 12 km outward at 12 km/h and the same distance back at 18 km/h. No stops. Estimate overall average speed in km/h. Round to 1 decimal place. Enter only the number.',NULL,'14.4','Total distance 24 km / total time (12/12+12/18) h = 14.4 km/h. Rounded result: 14.4.','Original average speed round trip exercise; worked solution in explanation. OpenStax: underlying mathematical methods','https://openstax.org/books/prealgebra-2e/pages/1-introduction','estimate',60),
