('43000000-0000-4000-8001-000000000078','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','A sheet is folded exactly in half 1 times, each time stacking all layers. A single tiny hole is punched through every layer at a point away from folds and edges, with all unfolded holes distinct. How many holes appear when the sheet is completely unfolded?','["3", "2", "1", "4"]','"2"','Each fold doubles the number of stacked layers. After 1 folds there are 2^1 = 2 layers, and the punch makes one hole in each. The distinct-hole condition excludes overlapping unfolded positions.','Original folded-paper multiplicity puzzle; worked solution in explanation. Background: Wikipedia Mathematical puzzle','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mathematical_puzzle','lateral',180),
('43000000-0000-4000-8001-000000000079','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','A sheet is folded exactly in half 2 times, each time stacking all layers. A single tiny hole is punched through every layer at a point away from folds and edges, with all unfolded holes distinct. How many holes appear when the sheet is completely unfolded?','["5", "3", "4", "6"]','"4"','Each fold doubles the number of stacked layers. After 2 folds there are 2^2 = 4 layers, and the punch makes one hole in each. The distinct-hole condition excludes overlapping unfolded positions.','Original folded-paper multiplicity puzzle; worked solution in explanation. Background: Wikipedia Mathematical puzzle','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mathematical_puzzle','lateral',180),
('43000000-0000-4000-8001-000000000080','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','A sheet is folded exactly in half 3 times, each time stacking all layers. A single tiny hole is punched through every layer at a point away from folds and edges, with all unfolded holes distinct. How many holes appear when the sheet is completely unfolded?','["9", "7", "10", "8"]','"8"','Each fold doubles the number of stacked layers. After 3 folds there are 2^3 = 8 layers, and the punch makes one hole in each. The distinct-hole condition excludes overlapping unfolded positions.','Original folded-paper multiplicity puzzle; worked solution in explanation. Background: Wikipedia Mathematical puzzle','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mathematical_puzzle','lateral',180),
