('43000000-0000-4000-8001-000000000089','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','You must take 3 tablets one at a time, exactly 20 minutes apart. You take the first tablet immediately. How many minutes from the first tablet until the last?','["40", "41", "39", "42"]','"40"','3 tablets create only 2 gaps. The elapsed time is (3-1)*20 = 40 minutes; counting a wait before the first dose adds a nonexistent interval.','Original endpoint timing puzzle; worked solution in explanation. Background: Wikipedia Mathematical puzzle','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mathematical_puzzle','lateral',180),
