('43000000-0000-4000-8001-000000000205','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','9 guests each hand over 20 dollars. The hotel retains 144 dollars, a porter keeps 9, and 27 dollars total are returned to the guests. After the refund, what is the guests'' combined net payment, including the porter''s share?','["153", "154", "152", "155"]','"153"','Net payment is original money minus refund: 180-27=153. It is also hotel plus porter: 144+9=153. Adding the porter''s share to the net payment counts it twice.','Original missing-money bookkeeping puzzle; worked solution in explanation. Background: Wikipedia Mathematical puzzle','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mathematical_puzzle','lateral',180),
