('42000000-0000-4000-8000-004000000001','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Who gives Harry the invisibility cloak at his first Hogwarts Christmas?','["Albus Dumbledore", "Voldemort", "Olympe Maxime", "Nagini"]','"Albus Dumbledore"','Dumbledore returns the cloak that James Potter had left in his care.','J. K. Rowling: Harry Potter seven-book series','https://www.harrypotter.com/discover/books','harry-potter',60),
('42000000-0000-4000-8000-004000000002','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Who lends Hagrid the flying motorbike used to bring baby Harry to Privet Drive?','["Garrick Ollivander", "Sirius Black", "Scabior", "Lavender Brown"]','"Sirius Black"','Hagrid uses Sirius''s motorbike after rescuing Harry from Godric''s Hollow.','J. K. Rowling: Harry Potter seven-book series','https://www.harrypotter.com/discover/books','harry-potter',60),
('42000000-0000-4000-8000-004000000003','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Who actually betrays James and Lily Potter''s location to Voldemort?','["Scabior", "Remus Lupin", "Peter Pettigrew", "Seamus Finnigan"]','"Peter Pettigrew"','Pettigrew was the Potters'' Secret Keeper and passed their location to Voldemort.','J. K. Rowling: Harry Potter seven-book series','https://www.harrypotter.com/discover/books','harry-potter',60),
('42000000-0000-4000-8000-004000000004','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Who destroys the diary Horcrux with a basilisk fang?','["Yaxley", "Fred Weasley", "Xenophilius Lovegood", "Harry Potter"]','"Harry Potter"','Harry stabs Tom Riddle''s diary in the Chamber of Secrets.','J. K. Rowling: Harry Potter seven-book series','https://www.harrypotter.com/discover/books','harry-potter',60),
('42000000-0000-4000-8000-004000000005','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Who opens the Chamber of Secrets while possessed by Tom Riddle''s diary?','["Ginny Weasley", "Cornelius Fudge", "Sirius Black", "Albus Dumbledore"]','"Ginny Weasley"','Riddle uses Ginny through the diary to release the basilisk.','J. K. Rowling: Harry Potter seven-book series','https://www.harrypotter.com/discover/books','harry-potter',60),
('42000000-0000-4000-8000-004000000006','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Who places Tom Riddle''s diary in Ginny''s schoolbooks at Flourish and Blotts?','["Pius Thicknesse", "Lucius Malfoy", "Kingsley Shacklebolt", "Fred Weasley"]','"Lucius Malfoy"','Lucius secretly slips the diary into Ginny''s belongings during the bookshop confrontation.','J. K. Rowling: Harry Potter seven-book series','https://www.harrypotter.com/discover/books','harry-potter',60),
('42000000-0000-4000-8000-004000000007','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Who is freed when Lucius Malfoy accidentally hands over Harry''s sock?','["Dennis Creevey", "Pomona Sprout", "Dobby", "Horace Slughorn"]','"Dobby"','Harry hides his sock in the diary, and Lucius gives it to his house-elf.','J. K. Rowling: Harry Potter seven-book series','https://www.harrypotter.com/discover/books','harry-potter',60),
('42000000-0000-4000-8000-004000000008','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Who puts Harry''s name into the Goblet of Fire?','["Angelina Johnson", "Petunia Dursley", "Mundungus Fletcher", "Barty Crouch Jr."]','"Barty Crouch Jr."','Disguised as Moody, Crouch enters Harry under a fourth school.','J. K. Rowling: Harry Potter seven-book series','https://www.harrypotter.com/discover/books','harry-potter',60),
('42000000-0000-4000-8000-004000000009','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Who lends Harry a copy of Advanced Potion-Making bearing the Half-Blood Prince''s notes?','["Horace Slughorn", "Oliver Wood", "Lee Jordan", "Rita Skeeter"]','"Horace Slughorn"','Slughorn lets Harry use an old textbook from the classroom cupboard.','J. K. Rowling: Harry Potter seven-book series','https://www.harrypotter.com/discover/books','harry-potter',60),
('42000000-0000-4000-8000-004000000010','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Who kills Dumbledore on the Astronomy Tower?','["Cornelius Fudge", "Severus Snape", "Bill Weasley", "Peter Pettigrew"]','"Severus Snape"','Snape carries out the death that he and Dumbledore had previously arranged.','J. K. Rowling: Harry Potter seven-book series','https://www.harrypotter.com/discover/books','harry-potter',60),
('42000000-0000-4000-8000-004000000011','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Who kills Nagini with the sword of Gryffindor?','["James Potter", "Rubeus Hagrid", "Neville Longbottom", "Cornelius Fudge"]','"Neville Longbottom"','Neville pulls the sword from the Sorting Hat and beheads Nagini.','J. K. Rowling: Harry Potter seven-book series','https://www.harrypotter.com/discover/books','harry-potter',60),
('42000000-0000-4000-8000-004000000012','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Who destroys the locket Horcrux with the sword of Gryffindor?','["Parvati Patil", "Rubeus Hagrid", "Neville Longbottom", "Ron Weasley"]','"Ron Weasley"','Ron returns to Harry and Hermione and destroys the locket after resisting its visions.','J. K. Rowling: Harry Potter seven-book series','https://www.harrypotter.com/discover/books','harry-potter',60),
('42000000-0000-4000-8000-004000000013','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Who destroys Hufflepuff''s cup Horcrux?','["Hermione Granger", "Arthur Weasley", "Albus Dumbledore", "Alastor Moody"]','"Hermione Granger"','Hermione uses a basilisk fang in the Chamber of Secrets during the Battle of Hogwarts.','J. K. Rowling: Harry Potter seven-book series','https://www.harrypotter.com/discover/books','harry-potter',60),
('42000000-0000-4000-8000-004000000014','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Who steals the original locket from Voldemort''s seaside cave?','["Fenrir Greyback", "Regulus Black", "The Fat Friar", "Dedalus Diggle"]','"Regulus Black"','Regulus substitutes a fake locket and sends Kreacher home with the real one.','J. K. Rowling: Harry Potter seven-book series','https://www.harrypotter.com/discover/books','harry-potter',60),
('42000000-0000-4000-8000-004000000015','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Who is ordered by Regulus to destroy the stolen locket?','["Amycus Carrow", "Bill Weasley", "Kreacher", "Olympe Maxime"]','"Kreacher"','Kreacher cannot destroy the Horcrux, although Regulus instructs him to do so.','J. K. Rowling: Harry Potter seven-book series','https://www.harrypotter.com/discover/books','harry-potter',60),
('42000000-0000-4000-8000-004000000016','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Who steals the locket from 12 Grimmauld Place and later gives it to Umbridge?','["Cho Chang", "Ernie Prang", "Moaning Myrtle", "Mundungus Fletcher"]','"Mundungus Fletcher"','Mundungus takes valuables from the house and surrenders the locket to Umbridge.','J. K. Rowling: Harry Potter seven-book series','https://www.harrypotter.com/discover/books','harry-potter',60),
('42000000-0000-4000-8000-004000000017','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Who wears Slytherin''s locket at the Ministry in Deathly Hallows?','["Dolores Umbridge", "Filius Flitwick", "Sirius Black", "Barty Crouch Jr."]','"Dolores Umbridge"','Umbridge falsely presents the locket as proof of her pure-blood ancestry.','J. K. Rowling: Harry Potter seven-book series','https://www.harrypotter.com/discover/books','harry-potter',60),
('42000000-0000-4000-8000-004000000018','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Who runs the Hog''s Head pub?','["Ginny Weasley", "Aberforth Dumbledore", "Dudley Dursley", "Sirius Black"]','"Aberforth Dumbledore"','Albus''s brother owns the pub that becomes a secret route into Hogwarts.','J. K. Rowling: Harry Potter seven-book series','https://www.harrypotter.com/discover/books','harry-potter',60),
('42000000-0000-4000-8000-004000000019','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Who edits The Quibbler?','["Seamus Finnigan", "Molly Weasley", "Xenophilius Lovegood", "Ludo Bagman"]','"Xenophilius Lovegood"','Luna''s father publishes the magazine, which prints Harry''s account of Voldemort''s return.','J. K. Rowling: Harry Potter seven-book series','https://www.harrypotter.com/discover/books','harry-potter',60),
('42000000-0000-4000-8000-004000000020','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Who discovers that Rita Skeeter is an unregistered Animagus?','["Arthur Weasley", "Arabella Figg", "Cho Chang", "Hermione Granger"]','"Hermione Granger"','Hermione catches Rita in her beetle form and uses the secret to restrain her reporting.','J. K. Rowling: Harry Potter seven-book series','https://www.harrypotter.com/discover/books','harry-potter',60),
('42000000-0000-4000-8000-004000000021','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Who turns into a werewolf when the full moon rises near the end of Prisoner of Azkaban?','["Remus Lupin", "Olympe Maxime", "Fleur Delacour", "Igor Karkaroff"]','"Remus Lupin"','Lupin has missed his Wolfsbane Potion and transforms outside the tunnel.','J. K. Rowling: Harry Potter seven-book series','https://www.harrypotter.com/discover/books','harry-potter',60),
