	('48000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000121','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','What is the length of an NBA overtime period?','["5 minutes", "3 minutes", "6 minutes", "10 minutes"]','"5 minutes"','Each NBA overtime period lasts five minutes; additional overtimes are played if needed.','Official NBA Rulebook: Rule 5','https://official.nba.com/rule-no-5-scoring-and-timing/','nba',60),
