	('48000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000124','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','A regular-season NBA game is tied after four quarters. What happens next?','["A free-throw shootout", "An automatic draw", "A sudden-death possession", "A five-minute overtime period"]','"A five-minute overtime period"','A tied regulation game proceeds to five-minute overtime, repeated if the score remains tied.','Official NBA Rulebook: Rule 5','https://official.nba.com/rule-no-5-scoring-and-timing/','nba',60),
	('48000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000125','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','When is the game clock stopped automatically after a made basket in the fourth quarter?','["During the last two minutes", "During the entire quarter", "Only during the last ten seconds", "It never stops after a made basket"]','"During the last two minutes"','Rule 5 stops the game clock after made baskets in the last two minutes of the fourth quarter and overtime.','Official NBA Rulebook: Rule 5','https://official.nba.com/rule-no-5-scoring-and-timing/','nba',60),
	('48000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000126','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','What is the normal initial NBA shot-clock limit for a new possession?','["20 seconds", "24 seconds", "30 seconds", "35 seconds"]','"24 seconds"','A team normally has 24 seconds to attempt a legal shot.','Official NBA Rulebook: Rule 7','https://official.nba.com/rule-no-7-24-second-clock/','nba',60),
	('48000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000127','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','An NBA offense rebounds its own shot after the ball touches the rim. To what is the shot clock reset?','["10 seconds", "18 seconds", "14 seconds", "24 seconds"]','"14 seconds"','An offensive rebound after the ball hits the rim resets the shot clock to 14 seconds.','Official NBA Rulebook: Rule 7','https://official.nba.com/rule-no-7-24-second-clock/','nba',60),
	('48000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000128','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','For a shot to beat the NBA shot-clock buzzer, when must it leave the shooter''s hand?','["Within one second after the signal", "Before the ball touches the rim", "Before the defense calls timeout", "Before the shot-clock signal sounds"]','"Before the shot-clock signal sounds"','The ball must leave the shooter''s hand before the shot-clock signal and then touch the rim or enter the basket.','Official NBA Rulebook: Rule 7','https://official.nba.com/rule-no-7-24-second-clock/','nba',60),
	('48000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000129','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','What must a missed shot touch to satisfy the NBA shot-clock requirement?','["The basket rim", "Only the backboard", "Any defender", "The net support"]','"The basket rim"','A legal shot-clock attempt must touch the ring unless it goes into the basket.','Official NBA Rulebook: Rule 7','https://official.nba.com/rule-no-7-24-second-clock/','nba',60),
	('48000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000130','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','How long does an NBA player generally have to release a throw-in after receiving the ball?','["3 seconds", "5 seconds", "8 seconds", "10 seconds"]','"5 seconds"','Rule 8 gives the inbounding player five seconds to release the ball.','Official NBA Rulebook: Rule 8','https://official.nba.com/rule-no-8-out-of-bounds-and-throw-in/','nba',60),
	('48000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000131','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','A player holding the ball steps on the sideline. What is the ruling?','["A jump ball", "A technical foul", "Out of bounds", "Play continues"]','"Out of bounds"','The boundary line is out of bounds, so a player touching it is out of bounds.','Official NBA Rulebook: Rule 8','https://official.nba.com/rule-no-8-out-of-bounds-and-throw-in/','nba',60),
	('48000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000132','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','Which team receives the throw-in when a defender last touches the ball before it goes out?','["The defensive team", "Whichever team wins a coin toss", "Neither team; it is always a jump ball", "The offensive team"]','"The offensive team"','The opponent of the player who last touched the ball receives possession for the throw-in.','Official NBA Rulebook: Rule 8','https://official.nba.com/rule-no-8-out-of-bounds-and-throw-in/','nba',60),
	('48000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000133','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','How long does an NBA player have to attempt a free throw after receiving the ball?','["10 seconds", "5 seconds", "8 seconds", "15 seconds"]','"10 seconds"','Rule 9 requires the shooter to attempt the free throw within 10 seconds.','Official NBA Rulebook: Rule 9','https://official.nba.com/rule-no-9-free-throws-and-penalties/','nba',60),
	('48000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000134','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','From where must an NBA free-throw shooter release the ball?','["Anywhere in the lane", "Within the semicircle and behind the free-throw line", "Directly beneath the rim", "With both feet on the line"]','"Within the semicircle and behind the free-throw line"','The shooter must stay behind the free-throw line and within the semicircle until the ball touches the ring or backboard.','Official NBA Rulebook: Rule 9','https://official.nba.com/rule-no-9-free-throws-and-penalties/','nba',60),
	('48000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000135','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','How long may an NBA offense take to advance the ball from its backcourt to its frontcourt?','["5 seconds", "10 seconds", "8 seconds", "12 seconds"]','"8 seconds"','An NBA team must advance the ball into its frontcourt within eight seconds.','Official NBA Rulebook: Rule 10','https://official.nba.com/rule-no-10-violations-and-penalties/','nba',60),
	('48000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000136','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','What is the maximum continuous time an offensive player may usually occupy the lane while the team controls the ball in the frontcourt?','["5 seconds", "8 seconds", "10 seconds", "3 seconds"]','"3 seconds"','The offensive three-second rule limits lane occupancy while the team controls the ball in the frontcourt, subject to specified exceptions.','Official NBA Rulebook: Rule 10','https://official.nba.com/rule-no-10-violations-and-penalties/','nba',60),
	('48000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000137','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','What is carrying the ball in NBA rules?','["Placing the hand under the ball and carrying it while dribbling", "Catching a legal pass with two hands", "Holding the ball before passing", "Taking a rebound above the rim"]','"Placing the hand under the ball and carrying it while dribbling"','A dribbler may not put a hand under the ball and carry it or pause and then resume the dribble.','Official NBA Rulebook: Rule 10','https://official.nba.com/rule-no-10-violations-and-penalties/','nba',60),
	('48000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000138','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','A dribbler stops, holds the ball, then starts another dribble without an intervening allowed event. What violation is this?','["Backcourt violation", "Illegal second dribble", "Offensive goaltending", "Three-second violation"]','"Illegal second dribble"','Once a dribble has ended, a new dribble is prohibited unless a rule exception applies.','Official NBA Rulebook: Rule 10','https://official.nba.com/rule-no-10-violations-and-penalties/','nba',60),
	('48000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000139','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','A team controls the ball in the frontcourt and returns it to the backcourt illegally. What is this called?','["Defensive three seconds", "Basket interference", "Backcourt violation", "A clear-path foul"]','"Backcourt violation"','Rule 10 restricts returning a controlled ball from the frontcourt to the backcourt.','Official NBA Rulebook: Rule 10','https://official.nba.com/rule-no-10-violations-and-penalties/','nba',60),
	('48000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000140','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','After gathering the ball while progressing, how many steps may an NBA player take to stop, pass, or shoot?','["One", "Three", "Four", "Two"]','"Two"','Rule 10 permits two steps after the gather while progressing; the timing of the gather matters.','Official NBA Rulebook: Rule 10','https://official.nba.com/rule-no-10-violations-and-penalties/','nba',60),
	('48000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000141','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','What starts a new NBA period''s clock after the opening jump ball?','["A legal tap by a jumper", "The referee entering the circle", "The ball first leaving the referee''s hand", "A player calling for the ball"]','"A legal tap by a jumper"','The clock starts when the tossed ball is legally tapped by a jumper.','Official NBA Rulebook: Rule 5','https://official.nba.com/rule-no-5-scoring-and-timing/','nba',60),
	('48000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000142','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','A defender touches a shot on its downward flight above the rim with a chance to score. What is the violation?','["Traveling", "Goaltending", "A backcourt violation", "A five-second violation"]','"Goaltending"','Touching such a shot on its downward flight is defensive goaltending.','Official NBA Rulebook: Rule 11','https://official.nba.com/rule-no-11-basket-interference-goaltending/','nba',60),
	('48000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000143','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','A player touches the ball while it is on the basket ring. What violation generally applies?','["Illegal screen", "Double dribble", "Basket interference", "Delay of game"]','"Basket interference"','Rule 11 prohibits touching the ball or basket when the ball is on the ring, subject to its stated exceptions.','Official NBA Rulebook: Rule 11','https://official.nba.com/rule-no-11-basket-interference-goaltending/','nba',60),
	('48000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000144','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','What happens when the defense goaltends a two-point field-goal attempt?','["One free throw is awarded", "The shot is replayed", "The defense gains possession with no points", "Two points are awarded to the offense"]','"Two points are awarded to the offense"','Defensive goaltending awards the value of the attempted field goal.','Official NBA Rulebook: Rule 11','https://official.nba.com/rule-no-11-basket-interference-goaltending/','nba',60),
