	('48000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000149','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','An NBA defender remains in the lane without actively guarding an opponent for too long. Which rule may apply?','["Defensive three seconds", "The eight-second rule", "The five-second inbound rule", "Offensive goaltending"]','"Defensive three seconds"','A defender in the lane must actively guard an opponent within the permitted three-second period or leave the lane.','Official NBA Rulebook: Rule 10','https://official.nba.com/rule-no-10-violations-and-penalties/','nba',60),
